@host = http://localhost:5056
# Get these from GET /sensors (step 1 below), then paste them here:
@sensorId = eb601796-e5bb-47ba-aca7-844f188796d2
@pumpId = PASTE-A-CONTROL-DEVICE-ID-HERE

### Send reading A (send this one, wait a few seconds)
POST {{host}}/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "{{sensorId}}", "value": { "watts": 101 } }

### Send reading B (send it, wait a few seconds)
POST {{host}}/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "{{sensorId}}", "value": { "watts": 202 } }

### Send reading C
POST {{host}}/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "{{sensorId}}", "value": { "watts": 303 } }

### 1. All history (copy the timestamp of reading B from here)
GET {{host}}/history/{{sensorId}}

### 2. Range query: replace the times with ones from step 1, using a window that only covers B
GET {{host}}/history/{{sensorId}}?since=2026-10-22T11:32:10Z&until=2026-10-22T11:32:20Z

### 3. Newest 2 only
GET {{host}}/history/{{sensorId}}?limit=2

### 4. Tree stats
GET {{host}}/history/{{sensorId}}/stats